{
  "ticket": "t-opt-t16",
  "_droppable": false,
  "_paired": true,
  "_role": "spec",
  "_what": "T16: nested-N paired measurement of optimization-3 with the T15 slots geometry. Every arm uses !synth <n> mode=slots (same fixed 8-slot ladder, only the first n synth slots enabled) so N is a nested subset and N-comparisons no longer mix the geometry variable (pre-review S25). Slots are 1.0-2.5 blocks ahead / +-2..8 lateral / slightly below the eye and all aim at the pool 6 blocks ahead -> light-to-pool distance 4-9.4 blocks (legacy arc ~2.5) so the per-sample DDA march is materially longer.",
  "_arm_order": "STRICT interleave: declared noise pair (t16-nz-x/y) first, back-to-back, identical config; then for each N_total in 4,5,6,8 three adjacent c,d pairs. Do not reorder.",
  "_analysis": "dX_i = FPS(c_i) - FPS(d_i) (positive = occl ON slower = no table benefit); benefit = -dX. Threshold ONLY from the declared back-to-back noise pair (D_adj); D_span is drift contrast only, never a threshold. Tools: tools/paired-analyze.ps1.",
  "_sensitivity": "X = max(D_adj, 1.0) FPS, D_adj from t16-nz-x vs t16-nz-y. 3 pairs per N: sign test 3/3 same sign is only p~0.125, so per-N verdicts are INDICATIVE; pool same-sign pairs across N and use D_adj for magnitude.",
  "_geometry_selfproof": "The SYNTH echo prints per light d2eye/d2roi/cosAng/inCone/spot/atten/ph/term/gatePass/insideSolid; term = spot*atten*ph is the exact composite1.fsh:142 cheap-gate expression (TACLIGHT_BEAM_NORM 0.4, TACLIGHT_ATTEN_K 20, taclight_attenuation taclight_core.glsl:166). gatePass=false or insideSolid=true => that light does not contribute at the ROI => arm invalid, now visible instead of silent.",
  "_conversion": "total ssbo count = 2 (self handheld + gun) + n (!synth n mode=slots); nested scan N_total = 4,5,6,8 -> n = 2,3,4,6. N_total=4 = block0-only control (slots 0..3, no row_b1).",
  "_judgment": {
    "negative_reproduced": "negative paired median reproduces at the same N => the T14 negative is not a legacy-geometry artefact",
    "positive_or_null": "~0 or positive benefit => T14 negative was geometry/measurement artefact and the mechanism candidates (bilinear fetch vs 2-3 DDA steps; row_b1 y-offset 256 locality) need follow-up experiments",
    "n_scaling": "|dX| growing with N_total => cost scales with table-served lights",
    "block0_control": "N_total=4 must be ~0 (both arms use the block0 table on the same 4 lights)"
  },
  "_min_decisive": "noise pair + N_total=8 pairs + N_total=4 pairs = 14 arms.",
  "_run": "powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools\\opt-verify-taclight.ps1 -Spec tickets\\t-opt-t16.json -Session T16 -BenchReps 3 -BenchWarmup 1 -Evidence ...\\qa6\\run-out-T16",
  "_prereq": "Window 1280x800; client restarted after compileJava syncShaderPack (fixture gained mode=slots + cheap-gate self-proof). Run tools\\check-synth-spec.ps1 first.",
  "scoped": "window 1280x800 / dev save test / scene wall / pose wall_front(2000.0,121.5,8.0,yaw180,pitch5) / midnight+clear+doMobSpawning false / wait 20 / single client + !synth n mode=slots (fixed 8-slot nested geometry) / relay !bench x3 (3s) median = PRIMARY",
